  "details": "User pages on Google Chrome (and other chromium-based browsers like Microsoft Edge) appear to force both the display name and username as \"text-transform: uppercase\", losing capitalization data on copying text.\nFirefox does not have this issue, and copying the display name & username both preserve capitalization (as intended).\nTested by multiple people.",
